  "title": {
   "en": "Akumade Taidana Akuyaku Kizoku"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "あくまで怠惰な悪役貴族@COMIC"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Lazy Aristocrat"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Lazy and Villainous Aristocrat"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Luke is the languid second son of a villainous duke. By some unexpected instance he comes to know of his own fate and in an attempt to avoid his own fate he works hard at finding a peaceful family to marry into and researching magic. All his hard work is to live a peaceful and slothful life... And yet he gets involved in one pain to deal with after the other!? The path of utmost sloth is a steep one.",
   "ja": "悪役公爵家次男に生まれたリュークは無気力な少年。ふとしたはずみで、自分を待ち受ける悲惨な未来を知ってしまった彼は、バッドエンドを回避するべく、安泰な婚家探しや魔法の研究に奔走していた。すべての努力は、平穏で怠惰な暮らしのため――それなのに次から次へとメンドークサイことに巻き込まれ…！？「怠惰を究める道は険しい……」"
  },
